        "rulings": [
            {
                "date": "2021-09-24",
                "text": "Augur of Autumn doesn't change the times when you can play a land card from the top of your library. You can play a land only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty. Doing so counts as your land play for the turn."
            },
            {
                "date": "2021-09-24",
                "text": "For three creatures to have different powers from one another, each of their powers needs to be different. A 1/1 creature, a 2/1 creature, and another 2/1 creature aren't three creatures with different powers."
            },
            {
                "date": "2021-09-24",
                "text": "You still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs."
            }
        ]
    },
